      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed we shouldn\u0027t be clearing Rx when we reset the PHY.  We\u0027re actually supposed to be going through this reset state more often than we do now (see b/158248741)\n\nReporting an error on discard is outside the spec (technically, getting a message when TX didn\u0027t succeed should be our clue there).  I was contemplating a specific discard flag to set for b/157228506 though.  I\u0027d like a specific discard indicator because the PE behavior needs to be different on discard than it would be for an actual protocol error.",
