      "writtenOn": "2020-06-08T17:03:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am worried that the PE layer will get locked up waiting forever on things if we don\u0027t send something.\n\nThere are placed were we wait on TX_SUCCESS or error forever and that scares me. I agree that this shouldn\u0027t be a protocol error, but really don\u0027t want the PE to get locked up. (we just need to figure out a way to prove to ourselves that the PE is resilaint to not getting anything back from the PRL layer)",
      "parentUuid": "da7ef15d_bf933b7c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 744,
